(7264291, 1129827, 28742, '<td valign="top">Well, if that''s how you wanna play it...<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenged.com/cms/image/DNMC-police.png'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenged.com/cms/image/DNMC-police.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenged.com/cms/image/DNMC-police.png"/></td>', 'Well, if that''s how you wanna play it...', '2014-09-19 04:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264292, 1130042, 28742, '<td valign="top">LOL - Excellent!</td>', 'LOL - Excellent!', '2014-09-19 04:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264293, 1130109, 28742, '<td valign="top">Brilliant and well executed. Only nitpick is the closeness to the background.</td>', 'Brilliant and well executed. Only nitpick is the closeness to the background.', '2014-09-19 04:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264329, 1130095, 109363, '<td valign="top">I think the original has both arm holding up the globe.  Nice idea</td>', 'I think the original has both arm holding up the globe.  Nice idea', '2014-09-19 09:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264330, 1129800, 109363, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but the image is quite dark, with no highlights or contrast to draw the eye to the subject.</td>', 'I like the concept, but the image is quite dark, with no highlights or contrast to draw the eye to the subject.', '2014-09-19 09:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264332, 1130023, 109363, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the photo seems blown out or overexposed</td>', 'Nice idea, but the photo seems blown out or overexposed', '2014-09-19 09:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264334, 1130038, 109363, '<td valign="top">Funny.  Sorry the photo went 90 degrees rotated, at least when viewed on an ipad</td>', 'Funny.  Sorry the photo went 90 degrees rotated, at least when viewed on an ipad', '2014-09-19 09:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264336, 1130022, 109363, '<td valign="top">The backlight probably should have been up higher... The way it is draws the eyes down to their feet.  Good concept.</td>', 'The backlight probably should have been up higher... The way it is draws the eyes down to their feet.  Good concept.', '2014-09-19 09:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264340, 1130080, 109363, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to make of this one.. Ilike the tones snd processing, but the meaning is not clear.  I had to google "la reve" to understand it meant "the dream"... Usually don''t want to have voters not "get it"</td>', 'Not sure what to make of this one.. Ilike the tones snd processing, but the meaning is not clear.  I had to google "la reve" to understand it meant "the dream"... Usually don''t want to have voters not "get it"', '2014-09-19 09:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264353, 1130073, 170281, '<td valign="top">Not sure how to rate the photo but I did have a good chuckle.</td>', 'Not sure how to rate the photo but I did have a good chuckle.', '2014-09-19 10:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264365, 1130042, 86447, '<td valign="top">Hahahahaha!   Brilliantly done, and fun too!</td>', 'Hahahahaha!   Brilliantly done, and fun too!', '2014-09-19 10:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264367, 1130023, 86447, '<td valign="top">Adorable!</td>', 'Adorable!', '2014-09-19 10:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264369, 1130022, 86447, '<td valign="top">Oh!   Too adorable!   And so well photographed!   I love this!</td>', 'Oh!   Too adorable!   And so well photographed!   I love this!', '2014-09-19 10:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264371, 1130038, 86447, '<td valign="top">Hahahahaha!   This is hilarious!</td>', 'Hahahahaha!   This is hilarious!', '2014-09-19 10:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264372, 1129905, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL!    This is... magnificent!</td>', 'LOL!    This is... magnificent!', '2014-09-19 10:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264373, 1129912, 86447, '<td valign="top">Go, Norman Rockwell!   Go!  <br/>I love this!   So fun and well done!</td>', 'Go, Norman Rockwell!   Go!  I love this!   So fun and well done!', '2014-09-19 10:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264375, 1130109, 86447, '<td valign="top">Hahahaha!   So fun!</td>', 'Hahahaha!   So fun!', '2014-09-19 10:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264377, 1130027, 86447, '<td valign="top">I actually laughed out loud.    Too fun!</td>', 'I actually laughed out loud.    Too fun!', '2014-09-19 10:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264381, 1129947, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wanted to lock up my Woody... tried it in so many different ways.<br/> <br/>Yours is much better than mine ever would have been.   <br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'I wanted to lock up my Woody... tried it in so many different ways. Yours is much better than mine ever would have been.    Well done!', '2014-09-19 10:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264382, 1130067, 86447, '<td valign="top">So tired... I love the posture of Woody.   Well done!</td>', 'So tired... I love the posture of Woody.   Well done!', '2014-09-19 10:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264386, 1130087, 86447, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge.<br/> <br/>So well shot and arranged and lit.</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge. So well shot and arranged and lit.', '2014-09-19 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264389, 1130017, 86447, '<td valign="top">Ha!</td>', 'Ha!', '2014-09-19 10:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264395, 1130101, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great concept. Nicely executed. Makes me feel like there is a story here - a statement about being different. In fact, the concepts come through very nicely and the photo doesn''t interfere with it in any way.</td>', 'Great concept. Nicely executed. Makes me feel like there is a story here - a statement about being different. In fact, the concepts come through very nicely and the photo doesn''t interfere with it in any way.', '2014-09-19 11:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264396, 1130058, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nicely abstracty</td>', 'Nicely abstracty', '2014-09-19 11:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264397, 1130077, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great concept - nicely executed. I find the joint on top of her(?) head distracting.</td>', 'Great concept - nicely executed. I find the joint on top of her(?) head distracting.', '2014-09-19 11:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264399, 1130079, 77196, '<td valign="top">Maybe even "Imprisoned". Interesting lighting. The stark contrast between light and dark add to the emotion of the image. The "bars" make woody''s right arm look REALLY long.</td>', 'Maybe even "Imprisoned". Interesting lighting. The stark contrast between light and dark add to the emotion of the image. The "bars" make woody''s right arm look REALLY long.', '2014-09-19 11:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264400, 1130068, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of texture. Jack and the bean (apple?) stalk? Conveys the impression of climbing to get to the fruit.</td>', 'Interesting use of texture. Jack and the bean (apple?) stalk? Conveys the impression of climbing to get to the fruit.', '2014-09-19 11:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264402, 1129947, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great collection of objects. I could see this on a witch''s work table. The purple bottle is a rather jolting departure from the color palette of the rest of the picture, but it seems to work (the label ties it in, I think)</td>', 'Great collection of objects. I could see this on a witch''s work table. The purple bottle is a rather jolting departure from the color palette of the rest of the picture, but it seems to work (the label ties it in, I think)', '2014-09-19 11:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264403, 1129713, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very abstracty. Not sure you''ve convinced me that''s really Woody. Title seems to not match the image (the figure appears to be holding a large pry bar or staff, rather than a lollipop). Nice grain and gradient.</td>', 'Very abstracty. Not sure you''ve convinced me that''s really Woody. Title seems to not match the image (the figure appears to be holding a large pry bar or staff, rather than a lollipop). Nice grain and gradient.', '2014-09-19 11:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264405, 1130100, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and nicely done. I like the visual juxtaposition of Woody and the tall building in the background; the rooftop and the billboard (or building) on the right side. Different elements, but providing balance to the image.</td>', 'Interesting concept and nicely done. I like the visual juxtaposition of Woody and the tall building in the background; the rooftop and the billboard (or building) on the right side. Different elements, but providing balance to the image.', '2014-09-19 11:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264406, 1129771, 77196, '<td valign="top">Made me smile. Great lighting. Except for the HUGE bolts / nuts, you almost see Woody the same size as a human.</td>', 'Made me smile. Great lighting. Except for the HUGE bolts / nuts, you almost see Woody the same size as a human.', '2014-09-19 11:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264407, 1129800, 77196, '<td valign="top">Ah! Great image. The darkness, body position, and lighting almost scream "sad" "depressed" "rejected". Your use of negative space on the right side adds nicely to the effect.</td>', 'Ah! Great image. The darkness, body position, and lighting almost scream "sad" "depressed" "rejected". Your use of negative space on the right side adds nicely to the effect.', '2014-09-19 11:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264408, 1130046, 77196, '<td valign="top">Smile. Love the mirroring of the dancer''s position. Love the color, motion blur, Woody standing on the bottom edge of the picture. I almost see Woody on top of a cab, driving through the city.</td>', 'Smile. Love the mirroring of the dancer''s position. Love the color, motion blur, Woody standing on the bottom edge of the picture. I almost see Woody on top of a cab, driving through the city.', '2014-09-19 11:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264409, 1130076, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great concept. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Great concept. Nice lighting.', '2014-09-19 11:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264410, 1129685, 77196, '<td valign="top">Awww... I love your use of perspective and proportion in this shot. Even have Woody on tiptoe to see out. I think the rug (the circles especially) add a lot to the image - it provides a welcoming factor to balance out the stark lines throughout the rest of the image.</td>', 'Awww... I love your use of perspective and proportion in this shot. Even have Woody on tiptoe to see out. I think the rug (the circles especially) add a lot to the image - it provides a welcoming factor to balance out the stark lines throughout the rest of the image.', '2014-09-19 11:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264411, 1130063, 77196, '<td valign="top">Grog revisited... Great concept and nicely executed. This stands out from the other entries in that it uses outdoors nature as the background. Tough to make a proportionally-correct scene, but you''ve carried it off nicely. Forgive the pun.</td>', 'Grog revisited... Great concept and nicely executed. This stands out from the other entries in that it uses outdoors nature as the background. Tough to make a proportionally-correct scene, but you''ve carried it off nicely. Forgive the pun.', '2014-09-19 11:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264412, 1130089, 77196, '<td valign="top">Smile. The cat really looks like it is listening. Great lighting. Not sure I understand the red string around Woody''s neck.</td>', 'Smile. The cat really looks like it is listening. Great lighting. Not sure I understand the red string around Woody''s neck.', '2014-09-19 11:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264414, 1130073, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not sure I''m buying this - the proportions are all wrong... Nice shallow DOF</td>', 'Not sure I''m buying this - the proportions are all wrong... Nice shallow DOF', '2014-09-19 11:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264415, 1130078, 77196, '<td valign="top">What is this - a nude beach?! Nice composition. Maybe a tad dark for a beach scene. I like the parallel patterns in the bottom 1/3.</td>', 'What is this - a nude beach?! Nice composition. Maybe a tad dark for a beach scene. I like the parallel patterns in the bottom 1/3.', '2014-09-19 11:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264417, 1130023, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. I love how the horses are looking opposite directions, thinking the whole thing boring and silly. The lighting seems to be a bit problematic - pretty washed out in the background, heavy shadow under the right Bulls-Eye''s head, and Woody looking too light on his arm and face.</td>', 'Nice concept. I love how the horses are looking opposite directions, thinking the whole thing boring and silly. The lighting seems to be a bit problematic - pretty washed out in the background, heavy shadow under the right Bulls-Eye''s head, and Woody looking too light on his arm and face.', '2014-09-19 11:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264419, 1130064, 77196, '<td valign="top">Overall the picture is dark and moody. But Pinocchio''s eyes convey an attitude of alarm that seem to be a contradiction to the overall mood of the photo. Lighting works - dark, but just not quite too dark.</td>', 'Overall the picture is dark and moody. But Pinocchio''s eyes convey an attitude of alarm that seem to be a contradiction to the overall mood of the photo. Lighting works - dark, but just not quite too dark.', '2014-09-19 11:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264421, 1130038, 77196, '<td valign="top">Cute. The background is picking up purple from the tree lights, and to my eye, that doesn''t quite blend with the aqua of the chair. The poses of the figures, and arrangement of the scene conveys "Christmas" quite nicely.</td>', 'Cute. The background is picking up purple from the tree lights, and to my eye, that doesn''t quite blend with the aqua of the chair. The poses of the figures, and arrangement of the scene conveys "Christmas" quite nicely.', '2014-09-19 11:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264422, 1130098, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wow! How did you do that? Great concept.</td>', 'Wow! How did you do that? Great concept.', '2014-09-19 11:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264423, 1129771, 16046, '<td valign="top">Best in show award, congrats</td>', 'Best in show award, congrats', '2014-09-19 11:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264424, 1130067, 77196, '<td valign="top">Effective use of light background to highlight Woody and the berries. Nice exposure.</td>', 'Effective use of light background to highlight Woody and the berries. Nice exposure.', '2014-09-19 11:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264425, 1130022, 16046, '<td valign="top">Top 2</td>', 'Top 2', '2014-09-19 11:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264426, 1130101, 16046, '<td valign="top">Top 3</td>', 'Top 3', '2014-09-19 11:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264428, 1129827, 77196, '<td valign="top">Why does the house look so leaning, and the fence so straight. The image is overexposed (sky is totally blown out), is quite grainy, has very soft focus, and the colors are muddy. I''m guessing there is more meaning, context, etc. here than what actually appears in the image. Oh, and Where''s Woody?</td>', 'Why does the house look so leaning, and the fence so straight. The image is overexposed (sky is totally blown out), is quite grainy, has very soft focus, and the colors are muddy. I''m guessing there is more meaning, context, etc. here than what actually appears in the image. Oh, and Where''s Woody?', '2014-09-19 12:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264460, 1130089, 86447, '<td valign="top">So well done!   And emotive.   Poor Woody and Kitty!</td>', 'So well done!   And emotive.   Poor Woody and Kitty!', '2014-09-19 14:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264461, 1129771, 86447, '<td valign="top">Lovely celebration!   Go, Woody!</td>', 'Lovely celebration!   Go, Woody!', '2014-09-19 14:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264464, 1129745, 86447, '<td valign="top">Love the black background for this... makes us focus on the calamity and hope that all will turn out all right.</td>', 'Love the black background for this... makes us focus on the calamity and hope that all will turn out all right.', '2014-09-19 14:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264465, 1130063, 86447, '<td valign="top">Ha!  <br/> <br/>I think the background is too busy for the scene to get the full attention that it deserves.   I struggle with this with Woody and the Doll challenge, etc.</td>', 'Ha!   I think the background is too busy for the scene to get the full attention that it deserves.   I struggle with this with Woody and the Doll challenge, etc.', '2014-09-19 14:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
