(7266255, 1130088, 65234, '<td valign="top">Gumby!!!  Of course he dances well; he''s bendable into any pose, as I recall.  Gotta'' give you a bonus point for Gumby.</td>', 'Gumby!!!  Of course he dances well; he''s bendable into any pose, as I recall.  Gotta'' give you a bonus point for Gumby.', '2014-09-25 19:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
